1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:05,086
Crossing high mountains and crossing valleys

2
00:00:05,447 --> 00:00:08,653
A ninja's body is like a plane, flying freely through the sky

3
00:00:08,905 --> 00:00:12,338
Honest, kind Hattori brings joy to everyone

4
00:00:12,492 --> 00:00:15,672
With eyes wide and round, and his little mouth shut tight

5
00:00:16,005 --> 00:00:19,406
Hiding his face behind a mask, cheeks puffed up

6
00:00:19,572 --> 00:00:22,730
Catching villains with agile moves, fast as lightning

7
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:26,497
Catching bad guys with wacky new tricks, just like magic

8
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,876
Speaking politely like poetry, full of charm and spirit

9
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:33,876
"Taking Good Photos Isn't Easy"

10
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:40,820
No matter how I look at it, I can't tell what you photographed

11
00:00:40,861 --> 00:00:43,220
Of course, the focus is all blurry in this one

12
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,739
Here, look at this one

13
00:00:48,027 --> 00:00:49,467
These photos are too ordinary

14
00:00:49,507 --> 00:00:50,822
I don't even know what to say

15
00:00:50,863 --> 00:00:53,390
You have to seize the moment to get a masterpiece

16
00:00:53,816 --> 00:00:56,010
I have a masterpiece to show you, here

17
00:00:57,072 --> 00:00:58,016
It's so ugly!

18
00:00:58,056 --> 00:01:01,042
How can we put this in our class newsletter?

19
00:01:01,642 --> 00:01:03,102
Yumeko...

20
00:01:03,182 --> 00:01:04,028
What is it?

21
00:01:04,069 --> 00:01:06,670
I put a lot of effort into taking this photo

22
00:01:12,123 --> 00:01:13,282
What should I do?

23
00:01:13,322 --> 00:01:16,440
How can I seize the moment and take great photos?

24
00:01:17,331 --> 00:01:19,426
Let me help you think of something

25
00:01:20,997 --> 00:01:22,458
Not this one either...

26
00:01:23,910 --> 00:01:24,784
It's this one

27
00:01:24,824 --> 00:01:27,597
Kenichi, you should copy how these photos were taken

28
00:01:29,338 --> 00:01:30,590
These look so nice

29
00:01:30,631 --> 00:01:32,028
Yeah

30
00:01:33,914 --> 00:01:36,594
Exactly, this photo turned out really nice, didn't it?

31
00:01:36,634 --> 00:01:38,796
Yeah... you have to seize the moment to take good photos

32
00:01:38,836 --> 00:01:41,319
Shinzo, looking for references in these books...

33
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:43,641
is a great idea, you're pretty sharp

34
00:01:43,681 --> 00:01:46,244
A ninja knows that when talking to clueless people...

35
00:01:46,284 --> 00:01:48,551
you have to show concrete examples

36
00:01:59,724 --> 00:02:00,758
Hey, is this good?

37
00:02:00,904 --> 00:02:02,524
It'd be even better if we got closer

38
00:02:02,681 --> 00:02:05,196
If there's any noise, the birds will fly away

39
00:02:05,237 --> 00:02:07,201
We have to be careful, got it?

40
00:02:17,714 --> 00:02:18,783
Let's go to the right

41
00:02:18,963 --> 00:02:21,622
Yan...

42
00:02:35,770 --> 00:02:37,812
Is around here okay?

43
00:02:37,852 --> 00:02:39,824
I'd like to get a bit closer

44
00:02:39,865 --> 00:02:41,335
Mm, yan...

45
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:54,259
This is truly a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity

46
00:02:54,299 --> 00:02:57,340
- Ow...
- This is great

47
00:03:01,802 --> 00:03:04,022
This is great, so great...

48
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:10,693
Great pose!

49
00:03:22,366 --> 00:03:23,819
Shishimaru!

50
00:03:26,164 --> 00:03:27,478
I'm so sorry!

51
00:03:28,151 --> 00:03:30,713
Please forgive me, forgive me!

52
00:03:32,811 --> 00:03:34,556
This time is a bit more dangerous

53
00:03:34,596 --> 00:03:37,437
But shooting down from up in a tree will definitely make a masterpiece

54
00:03:37,799 --> 00:03:39,458
I'm not afraid of any danger

55
00:03:39,499 --> 00:03:41,692
The most important thing is seizing the right moment

56
00:03:41,733 --> 00:03:43,560
You've really got determination

57
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,560
Yan...

58
00:03:44,666 --> 00:03:46,842
Shishimaru, you're such a scatterbrain

59
00:03:46,882 --> 00:03:48,503
So you have to stay here

60
00:03:53,774 --> 00:03:55,427
Yan...

61
00:04:02,347 --> 00:04:03,793
Kenichi!

62
00:04:03,834 --> 00:04:06,927
I know, I'm not scared of anything if it's for a great photo!

63
00:04:07,014 --> 00:04:08,360
Yan...

64
00:04:08,427 --> 00:04:11,054
You can see more clearly from this spot

65
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,307
Hurry up, come on!

66
00:04:17,112 --> 00:04:18,618
This is the best spot

67
00:04:18,658 --> 00:04:20,551
Hattori-kun, make sure you hold onto me tight, okay?

68
00:04:20,592 --> 00:04:21,819
Yan...

69
00:04:25,686 --> 00:04:26,772
Right

70
00:04:37,156 --> 00:04:39,138
I was way too careless!

71
00:04:41,636 --> 00:04:44,563
I have to take a masterpiece!

72
00:04:45,837 --> 00:04:47,838
Yan...

73
00:04:56,094 --> 00:04:59,838
It's a ninjutsu for communicating with ducks, yan...

74
00:05:00,888 --> 00:05:03,501
Could you please help out?

75
00:05:03,542 --> 00:05:04,468
Please!

76
00:05:07,381 --> 00:05:10,134
Thank you so much, I am truly grateful

77
00:05:10,447 --> 00:05:11,219
That's great!

78
00:05:11,260 --> 00:05:14,140
Today I'm going to take some once-in-a-lifetime photos!

79
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:17,498
Little ducks, whether this succeeds is all up to you!

80
00:05:22,984 --> 00:05:24,564
Here's my chance!

81
00:05:27,884 --> 00:05:30,301
Got it, that was amazing!

82
00:05:30,341 --> 00:05:31,782
Kenichi, you're really something!

83
00:05:31,822 --> 00:05:33,584
Hurry over here and keep shooting!

84
00:05:36,781 --> 00:05:37,984
Got another great shot!

85
00:05:38,024 --> 00:05:39,641
This is a rare opportunity!

86
00:05:43,072 --> 00:05:46,109
I never imagined I'd be a genius photographer!

87
00:05:46,150 --> 00:05:47,676
Yan...

88
00:05:51,774 --> 00:05:53,868
Awesome, that was incredible!

89
00:05:56,262 --> 00:05:58,682
These are all masterpieces!

90
00:06:02,999 --> 00:06:06,062
Oh no, I didn't even put any film in!

91
00:06:10,178 --> 00:06:12,455
I'm sorry, I am so terribly sorry!

92
00:06:12,495 --> 00:06:13,507
Yan...

93
00:06:13,733 --> 00:06:15,735
So you won the ducks over, big brother

94
00:06:15,775 --> 00:06:17,449
No wonder it went so well!

95
00:06:17,490 --> 00:06:19,255
No wonder the ducks were so obedient

96
00:06:19,295 --> 00:06:21,860
Yan...

97
00:06:23,256 --> 00:06:26,632
I am truly sorry, yan...

98
00:06:29,252 --> 00:06:31,766
"Tigers Out of the Cage"

99
00:06:36,781 --> 00:06:38,243
Take this!

100
00:06:45,023 --> 00:06:46,477
Ouch, I give up!

101
00:06:46,517 --> 00:06:47,910
Shinzo, you're so agile!

102
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:49,513
There's no way I could beat you

103
00:06:49,553 --> 00:06:51,475
Kenichi, you're way too lousy

104
00:06:51,515 --> 00:06:54,301
Come on, Shishimaru, let me fight you!

105
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,714
Sure, let's fight then!

106
00:06:55,755 --> 00:06:57,287
As if I'm scared of you! Let's go!

107
00:07:00,772 --> 00:07:01,898
Alright!

108
00:07:02,244 --> 00:07:03,885
Here I come... Ouch!

109
00:07:09,594 --> 00:07:12,334
I'm really useless, even a dog fights better than me

110
00:07:16,282 --> 00:07:17,963
Attention, all citizens!

111
00:07:18,135 --> 00:07:20,354
Two tigers have escaped from the Beast Circus!

112
00:07:20,395 --> 00:07:22,949
Their whereabouts are currently unknown

113
00:07:23,539 --> 00:07:25,153
The situation is extremely dangerous

114
00:07:25,194 --> 00:07:26,817
Please close all doors and windows immediately

115
00:07:26,858 --> 00:07:28,457
Do not go outside under any circumstances!

116
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:30,618
If I catch those tigers...

117
00:07:30,658 --> 00:07:33,124
Then I'll instantly become the city's biggest hero!

118
00:07:33,165 --> 00:07:35,099
-I don't want to do this, I'm leaving
-That'd be so glorious!

119
00:07:35,139 --> 00:07:37,362
-Oh no, I'm getting out of here too
-Kagechiyo!

120
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:40,699
Are you scared of the tigers and trying to sneak away?

121
00:07:40,739 --> 00:07:41,807
Is that right?

122
00:07:42,021 --> 00:07:43,459
Why would I be scared of a tiger?

123
00:07:43,499 --> 00:07:45,793
Both tigers are still missing at this moment

124
00:07:45,898 --> 00:07:47,858
Please ensure all doors and windows are shut tight

125
00:07:47,898 --> 00:07:49,741
Oh dear, that's terrifying!

126
00:07:50,157 --> 00:07:51,580
Scared me half to death

127
00:07:53,675 --> 00:07:56,648
Kenichi! Kenichi!

128
00:07:56,866 --> 00:08:00,074
Kenichi, Shinzo, and Shishimaru
haven't come home yet

129
00:08:00,388 --> 00:08:01,574
What should we do?

130
00:08:01,615 --> 00:08:03,046
Hattori-kun

131
00:08:03,679 --> 00:08:05,959
Mother, let me go bring them back

132
00:08:05,999 --> 00:08:08,613
Yan...

133
00:08:16,564 --> 00:08:17,587
Come on!

134
00:08:23,712 --> 00:08:26,074
You have to aim properly if you want to win

135
00:08:26,114 --> 00:08:27,536
Got it?

136
00:08:31,281 --> 00:08:32,868
It's a kitten!

137
00:08:34,450 --> 00:08:35,338
So cute!

138
00:08:35,398 --> 00:08:36,871
A kitten!

139
00:08:37,577 --> 00:08:38,803
Was it abandoned?

140
00:08:38,843 --> 00:08:41,406
- Who could bear to abandon such a cute kitten?
- Exactly!

141
00:08:41,446 --> 00:08:42,927
All right, let's keep it!

142
00:08:43,227 --> 00:08:43,841
Here

143
00:08:43,881 --> 00:08:45,015
No way, you can't do that

144
00:08:45,056 --> 00:08:46,335
Why not?

145
00:08:47,541 --> 00:08:49,692
It looks so cute

146
00:08:50,078 --> 00:08:51,392
I hate cats the most!

147
00:09:04,067 --> 00:09:05,780
It must be around here

148
00:09:09,905 --> 00:09:10,798
All done drawing!

149
00:09:10,839 --> 00:09:12,639
Here, now you're a tiger

150
00:09:13,651 --> 00:09:15,444
All right, now go find that tiger quickly

151
00:09:15,711 --> 00:09:16,900
Okay, all right, go!

152
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:18,267
Go quickly, understand?

153
00:09:18,307 --> 00:09:20,588
When you find the tiger, bring it back here to me!

154
00:09:20,642 --> 00:09:22,346
All right, got it...

155
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,606
Pull yourself together!

156
00:09:32,767 --> 00:09:34,080
A tiger...

157
00:09:43,428 --> 00:09:44,957
Oh no, please don't!

158
00:09:44,998 --> 00:09:46,364
How many lives do I have...

159
00:09:48,041 --> 00:09:49,721
No... I'm terrified!

160
00:09:49,762 --> 00:09:51,495
Oh no, I'm so scared, so scared...

161
00:09:51,535 --> 00:09:52,741
No...

162
00:09:53,027 --> 00:09:55,373
Outrageous! I'll take it head-on!

163
00:10:09,991 --> 00:10:11,382
Mind your own business!

164
00:10:11,423 --> 00:10:13,245
Now is not the time to pick a fight!

165
00:10:13,304 --> 00:10:15,392
We should team up to deal with the tiger!

166
00:10:15,839 --> 00:10:17,725
Strange, what is it doing?

167
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:20,950
I heard two tigers escaped in total

168
00:10:20,990 --> 00:10:23,854
Does that mean it's looking for the other tiger?

169
00:10:27,421 --> 00:10:28,393
After it, quick!

170
00:10:28,434 --> 00:10:30,274
Yan...

171
00:10:30,428 --> 00:10:32,113
Hmph, what's so cute about cats?

172
00:10:32,201 --> 00:10:35,519
- Kittens really are so cute
- Let's definitely adopt it!

173
00:10:35,735 --> 00:10:36,418
All right!

174
00:10:36,459 --> 00:10:37,415
I object!

175
00:10:51,656 --> 00:10:53,291
What on earth is going on?

176
00:11:04,197 --> 00:11:06,071
Kemumaki, go notify the circus quickly!

177
00:11:06,111 --> 00:11:06,871
All right!

178
00:11:14,905 --> 00:11:16,004
Play dead!

179
00:11:17,874 --> 00:11:19,600
Kitten!

180
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:22,688
- No, help!
- I'm so scared...

181
00:11:22,729 --> 00:11:24,307
- I'm so scared!
- I'm so scared!

182
00:11:26,177 --> 00:11:28,372
Brother Tiger, let's talk this through calmly

183
00:11:28,412 --> 00:11:30,801
Yan...

184
00:11:35,175 --> 00:11:36,175
Yan...

185
00:11:38,487 --> 00:11:39,629
Yan...

186
00:11:39,670 --> 00:11:41,162
- We won!
- We won!

187
00:11:52,128 --> 00:11:53,411
Yan...

188
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:57,131
Yan...

189
00:11:57,625 --> 00:11:58,837
Yan...

190
00:11:59,286 --> 00:12:00,885
What are you two even talking about?

191
00:12:00,925 --> 00:12:03,604
He says the tiger cub didn't listen and ran away

192
00:12:03,644 --> 00:12:05,364
So the tiger mom came out too

193
00:12:05,404 --> 00:12:06,803
hoping to find her son

194
00:12:06,843 --> 00:12:10,019
I'm so sorry, I shouldn't have brought him back

195
00:12:17,593 --> 00:12:20,417
All right, we'll come visit you at the circus some other day

196
00:12:20,457 --> 00:12:21,939
Until next time!

197
00:12:21,979 --> 00:12:23,548
Yan...

198
00:12:25,362 --> 00:12:28,120
"The Wrong Gift"

199
00:12:33,152 --> 00:12:34,794
Sigh, why is there so much work to do?

200
00:12:34,835 --> 00:12:37,137
I'm so busy my head is spinning

201
00:12:40,435 --> 00:12:43,052
Mr. Mitsuba, delivery from Ryogetsu Company!

202
00:12:43,092 --> 00:12:44,132
Is anyone home?

203
00:12:44,172 --> 00:12:45,138
Coming!

204
00:12:45,184 --> 00:12:46,651
We have a delivery for you

205
00:12:46,691 --> 00:12:48,026
Please grab your seal

206
00:12:48,474 --> 00:12:49,720
We need to stamp it

207
00:12:49,821 --> 00:12:51,228
Right...

208
00:12:51,691 --> 00:12:53,650
Where is the stamp?

209
00:12:53,691 --> 00:12:56,199
Where did Mom put that seal?

210
00:12:56,959 --> 00:12:58,016
Hattori-kun

211
00:12:58,050 --> 00:13:00,057
Yan...

212
00:13:00,449 --> 00:13:01,769
Ah, it's over there

213
00:13:01,809 --> 00:13:03,653
The seal is right inside

214
00:13:06,490 --> 00:13:08,715
Here, take a look

215
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:10,266
You're right!

216
00:13:10,307 --> 00:13:11,729
It's the Ninja X-Ray Vision Technique

217
00:13:11,769 --> 00:13:12,915
Awesome!

218
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,848
I remember Mom put it away here last time

219
00:13:15,889 --> 00:13:19,260
We ninjas have sharp memories, you know?

220
00:13:19,689 --> 00:13:20,643
All set

221
00:13:21,008 --> 00:13:21,768
Goodbye!

222
00:13:22,206 --> 00:13:23,556
Mr. Delivery Man, what about the package?

223
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:25,344
Oh right... Here, this is for you

224
00:13:25,642 --> 00:13:27,262
Thanks for your hard work

225
00:13:27,681 --> 00:13:29,158
It's a New Year's gift

226
00:13:30,408 --> 00:13:31,319
Hattori-kun

227
00:13:31,359 --> 00:13:32,743
I wonder what's inside

228
00:13:32,784 --> 00:13:33,880
Yan...

229
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:36,715
I can use my X-ray vision technique to see inside

230
00:13:36,756 --> 00:13:38,036
X-ray vision?

231
00:13:38,205 --> 00:13:40,443
Can you really see what's in there?

232
00:13:40,483 --> 00:13:41,822
You bet!

233
00:13:42,156 --> 00:13:45,317
Even so, ninjas have to observe carefully in daily life

234
00:13:45,365 --> 00:13:47,925
Remember where things are placed, and combined with X-ray vision...

235
00:13:47,965 --> 00:13:49,605
it's guaranteed to work

236
00:13:50,293 --> 00:13:52,472
Turns out it's a huge cake!

237
00:13:53,126 --> 00:13:55,139
- It's not soap?
- Let's eat!

238
00:13:55,180 --> 00:13:56,445
Come on, let's eat!

239
00:13:56,486 --> 00:13:57,428
We can't do that

240
00:13:57,475 --> 00:14:00,734
We have to wait until Mom and Dad get home, right?

241
00:14:00,869 --> 00:14:02,089
*sigh* We've waited so long

242
00:14:02,129 --> 00:14:04,612
Alright... everyone step three feet back from the table

243
00:14:04,652 --> 00:14:06,094
- Yes...
- Yes...

244
00:14:10,741 --> 00:14:13,064
That should do it, yan...

245
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:21,518
Hey, Shishimaru, where are you going?

246
00:14:22,417 --> 00:14:24,875
Don't forget you've got a rope tied around your neck

247
00:14:24,915 --> 00:14:27,688
You want to sneak a piece of cake? Not that easy

248
00:14:27,908 --> 00:14:29,500
Actually, I'm really hungry too

249
00:14:29,540 --> 00:14:31,031
Me too

250
00:14:31,494 --> 00:14:32,460
How about this?

251
00:14:32,500 --> 00:14:34,109
Let's all three of us eat it together, okay?

252
00:14:34,149 --> 00:14:35,456
Alright, let's go eat it quickly

253
00:14:35,516 --> 00:14:38,481
Right, as long as Hattori-kun doesn't find out

254
00:14:43,076 --> 00:14:44,703
Oh no, what is this?

255
00:14:45,623 --> 00:14:47,137
Yan...

256
00:14:47,681 --> 00:14:49,723
If we don't hurry, big brother will be back

257
00:14:49,763 --> 00:14:51,365
That's right, hurry up, hurry!

258
00:14:56,685 --> 00:14:59,609
I told you not to eat it, you're so disobedient

259
00:15:01,381 --> 00:15:03,168
It's already too late now

260
00:15:03,208 --> 00:15:04,620
When Mom and Dad get back in a bit

261
00:15:04,660 --> 00:15:06,259
They'll definitely blow their tops at you

262
00:15:06,299 --> 00:15:07,966
I can't help you anymore

263
00:15:09,307 --> 00:15:12,347
"Block 1, No. 2, Totsuyama"? It wasn't meant for us!

264
00:15:12,789 --> 00:15:15,519
Turns out this cake belongs to Mr. Totsuyama next door

265
00:15:17,152 --> 00:15:18,722
Is... is that true?

266
00:15:18,762 --> 00:15:20,245
Is anybody home?

267
00:15:20,285 --> 00:15:21,075
Oh no, we're in big trouble

268
00:15:21,115 --> 00:15:23,275
It's the lady next door, what do we do?

269
00:15:23,316 --> 00:15:25,020
Mrs. Mitsuba, is anyone home?

270
00:15:25,061 --> 00:15:27,218
Yes, just a moment!

271
00:15:28,370 --> 00:15:29,661
Where is your mother?

272
00:15:29,702 --> 00:15:31,049
She went shopping

273
00:15:31,089 --> 00:15:32,693
Really? I see

274
00:15:32,733 --> 00:15:35,014
The department store might deliver something for us today

275
00:15:35,054 --> 00:15:37,095
And since I wasn't home, I thought

276
00:15:37,135 --> 00:15:38,896
Maybe it got left at your house for now

277
00:15:38,936 --> 00:15:40,298
I wonder if it's here?

278
00:15:40,416 --> 00:15:41,851
N-No...

279
00:15:41,892 --> 00:15:43,612
N-No one delivered anything here

280
00:15:43,653 --> 00:15:44,819
R-Really, nothing

281
00:15:44,859 --> 00:15:45,885
Oh, really?

282
00:15:45,926 --> 00:15:47,900
Alright, then I'll go back home and wait a bit longer

283
00:15:47,940 --> 00:15:49,389
Goodbye, everyone

284
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,040
We're really in trouble this time

285
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:55,240
It got delivered to our place by mistake, so now what?

286
00:15:55,280 --> 00:15:58,080
It's all because you were greedy, you ruined everything

287
00:15:58,120 --> 00:16:00,581
What should we do? We have to think of a plan

288
00:16:00,621 --> 00:16:01,519
What should we do?

289
00:16:01,559 --> 00:16:05,159
Too bad our allowance is all gone, we can't buy a replacement

290
00:16:05,199 --> 00:16:06,919
Why don't we just tell her the truth?

291
00:16:06,959 --> 00:16:08,639
Just say you ate it, and that's that

292
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:11,562
No way, everyone knows that lady is a huge blabbermouth!

293
00:16:11,603 --> 00:16:14,164
If she finds out, she'll definitely badmouth us everywhere

294
00:16:14,204 --> 00:16:16,927
We won't be able to show our faces, no way!

295
00:16:16,967 --> 00:16:18,777
Right, yes, that's right

296
00:16:18,818 --> 00:16:21,498
How about we just return the empty box to her, huh?

297
00:16:21,539 --> 00:16:23,993
No way, no way, how could we do that?

298
00:16:24,126 --> 00:16:26,937
Hattori-kun, please help us out!

299
00:16:31,032 --> 00:16:32,216
Yan...

300
00:16:32,289 --> 00:16:33,911
Mom and Dad are coming back right now!

301
00:16:33,951 --> 00:16:36,292
All right, time for the Ninja Transformation Guiding Technique!

302
00:16:36,431 --> 00:16:37,668
Yan...

303
00:16:38,318 --> 00:16:39,344
Dear, what's wrong?

304
00:16:39,385 --> 00:16:41,470
For some reason my legs won't listen to me

305
00:16:41,510 --> 00:16:43,517
Stop joking around

306
00:16:44,324 --> 00:16:46,909
Oh right, we should buy some snacks for Kenichi and the others

307
00:16:46,949 --> 00:16:49,438
Since they've been so good watching the house

308
00:16:50,728 --> 00:16:51,685
All right

309
00:16:53,605 --> 00:16:56,002
How about we buy them this box of cookies?

310
00:16:56,042 --> 00:16:58,182
Sure, whatever you like

311
00:16:58,963 --> 00:17:00,610
Yan...

312
00:17:01,450 --> 00:17:02,550
Yan...

313
00:17:03,644 --> 00:17:05,184
Dear, you want to buy this one?

314
00:17:05,297 --> 00:17:06,885
No, my hand just grabbed it on its own

315
00:17:06,925 --> 00:17:08,109
You're joking again

316
00:17:08,150 --> 00:17:09,432
I'm buying this one

317
00:17:13,509 --> 00:17:15,871
All of a sudden, I feel totally relaxed

318
00:17:15,911 --> 00:17:16,791
What's with you?

319
00:17:16,831 --> 00:17:18,832
Are you getting old and having aches and pains?

320
00:17:18,872 --> 00:17:21,155
Are you kidding? I'm still young!

321
00:17:22,114 --> 00:17:23,437
We're home!

322
00:17:24,995 --> 00:17:26,620
Here, since you were so good watching the house

323
00:17:26,676 --> 00:17:28,527
we bought this treat for you, here

324
00:17:28,637 --> 00:17:30,238
Kenichi, what's wrong?

325
00:17:30,278 --> 00:17:31,598
Hey, Shinzo

326
00:17:36,818 --> 00:17:38,701
This is a cake!

327
00:17:38,741 --> 00:17:39,739
That's wonderful!

328
00:17:39,779 --> 00:17:41,940
Even the wrapping paper is identical!

329
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:43,785
-Yay!
-Yay!

330
00:17:43,892 --> 00:17:45,420
Come on, I'll cut it

331
00:17:45,460 --> 00:17:46,781
Let's all eat together

332
00:17:46,821 --> 00:17:48,501
No... don't cut it yet!

333
00:17:48,541 --> 00:17:49,622
Hey, what's the matter?

334
00:17:49,662 --> 00:17:51,222
Don't you like cake?

335
00:17:51,262 --> 00:17:52,570
There's no other choice

336
00:17:52,764 --> 00:17:54,954
Shinzo, let's hurry and take it next door

337
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:55,847
Kenichi

338
00:17:55,888 --> 00:17:56,893
What on earth is going on?

339
00:17:56,934 --> 00:17:57,867
Here's what happened

340
00:17:57,907 --> 00:18:00,150
They accidentally ate the lady next door's cake

341
00:18:00,196 --> 00:18:02,311
So they ate someone else's cake?

342
00:18:03,431 --> 00:18:05,971
Kenichi, that was actually pretty good of you guys

343
00:18:06,987 --> 00:18:09,403
Lately, I seem to have a real knack for shopping

344
00:18:09,443 --> 00:18:11,944
I even buy whatever the kids are craving

345
00:18:12,891 --> 00:18:14,970
That was a really close shave

346
00:18:15,010 --> 00:18:18,255
I wonder why kids love cake so much

347
00:18:18,295 --> 00:18:19,966
Yan...
